  "description": "URL Viewer for Umbraco (17 and 18): a backoffice tool in the \"SEO Audit\" section to fetch any URL as Googlebot/Bingbot (or a browser), follow the full redirect chain, view headers and HTML source, and run a static analysis â€” on-page SEO, Open Graph/Twitter, technical SEO, content and accessibility metrics, spam/hidden-CSS/JavaScript detection and cloaking â€” with a composite SEO score. Also exposes an authenticated API to fetch a URL and return the analysis as JSON. Server-side and SSRF-safe. Built on the framework-agnostic T4VN.Seo.Core engine. (For the site-wide crawler, install uTPro.Feature.SEOAudit.)",
